s vain.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey iman edenler! Allah'a itaat edin, Peygamber'e itaat edin ve amellerinizi boşa çıkarmayın.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے ایمان والو اللہ کا حکم مانو اور رسول کا حکم مانو اور اپنے عمل باطل نہ کرو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hai orang-orang yang beriman, taatilah Allah dan taatilah Rasul dan janganlah kamu merusakkan (pahala) amal-amalmu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَطِيعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَطِيعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّسُولَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُبْطِلُوٓا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/56898aa9872db72c0df8.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "poništavajte", "en": "render vain", "tr": "boşa çıkarmayın", "fr": "rendez vains", "id": "janganlah kalian membatalkan", "ur": "تم اکارت نہ کرو", "bn": "তোমরা নিষ্ফল করো না", "fa": "باطل نکنید"}}, {"text": "أَعْمَٰلَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "8:8", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1168.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "That He might cause the Truth to triumph and bring vanity to naught, however much the guilty might oppose;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ki, hakkın hak olduğunu tanıtsın ve batılı büsbütün yok etsin, varsın o günahkârlar istemesin.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ سچ کو سچ کرے اور جھوٹ کو جھوٹا پڑے برا مانیں مجرم،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "agar Allah menetapkan yang hak (Islam) dan membatalkan yang batil (syirik) walaupun orang-orang yang berdosa (musyrik) itu tidak menyukainya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِيُحِقَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيُبْطِلَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d0095a78ea28ee058810.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i da poništi", "en": "and nullify", "tr": "ve boşa çıkarsın", "fr": "et qu'il annule", "id": "dan agar Dia membatalkan", "ur": "اور وہ باطل کرے", "bn": "এবং যেন তিনি নিষ্ফল করে দেন", "fa": "و باطل کند"}}, {"text": "ٱلْبَٰطِلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَرِهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تُبْطِلُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "2:264", "audio": "audio/9f5b3fe09df5f24b127d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) nullify", "bs": "poništavate", "tr": "geçersiz kılarsınız", "fr": "vous annulez", "id": "kalian membatalkan", "ur": "تم سب باطل کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা বাতিল কর", "fa": "باطل کنید"}}, {"arabic": "وَيُبْطِلَ", "count": 1, "first": "8:8", "audio": "audio/d0095a78ea28ee058810.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "i da poništi", "en": "and nullify", "tr": "ve geçersiz kılsın", "fr": "et qu'il annule", "id": "dan membatalkan", "ur": "اور باطل کرو!", "bn": "এবং বাতিল করে", "fa": "و تا باطل کند"}}, {"arabic": "سَيُبْطِلُهُۥٓ", "count": 1, "first": "10:81", "audio": "audio/282461707803a51bc977.m4a", "grammar": [{